<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
  <head>
    <title>Safe Logins</title>
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
    <%= csrf_meta_tags %>
    <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.1/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
    <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.0.2/dist/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js"></script>
    <script src="https://kit.fontawesome.com/8142b3c685.js" crossorigin="anonymous"></script>
    <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/clipboard@2.0.10/dist/clipboard.min.js"></script>

    <%= javascript_include_tag 'manifest' %>
    <%= javascript_include_tag 'profile' %>

    <%= javascript_include_tag 'application' %>
    <%= javascript_include_tag 'password' %>
    <%= javascript_include_tag 'dashboard' %>
    <%= javascript_include_tag 'loading-bar' %>

    <%= stylesheet_link_tag "application" %>
    <%= stylesheet_link_tag "loading-bar" %>

    <script src="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/jquery.mask/1.14.16/jquery.mask.min.js" integrity="sha512-pHVGpX7F/27yZ0ISY+VVjyULApbDlD0/X0rgGbTqCE7WFW5MezNTWG/dnhtbBuICzsd0WQPgpE4REBLv+UqChw==" crossorigin="anonymous" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"></script>

  </head>
  <body  style="" class="">

<div class="w3-sidebar" style="width:25%; background: red;">
  <a href="#" class="w3-bar-item w3-button">Link 1</a>
  <a href="#" class="w3-bar-item w3-button">Link 2</a>
  <a href="#" class="w3-bar-item w3-button">Link 3</a>
</div>

<div style="margin-left:25%">

<div class="w3-container w3-dark-grey">
  <h1>My Page</h1>
</div>

<div class="w3-container">
  <p>Use the w3-color class to change the background color of the sidebar.</p>
  <p>If you want an active/current link, to let the user know which page he/she is on, add the w3-color class to one of the links as well.</p>
</div>

</div>

  </body>
</html>

<style>
.w3-sidebar{height:100%;width:200px;background-color:#fff;position:fixed!important;z-index:1;overflow:visible;}
.w3-container,.w3-panel{padding:0.01em 16px}
</style>